# eu-og3u6 shape: 900 padding declarations render before the failing one.
# The primary label and the user trace anchor must name 'result' — the
# declaration that actually made the failing call — not whichever binding
# happened to be rendered first. With a two-line file the anchor is right,
# so only a many-declaration fixture can see this.
